v>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-03T20:59:06-07:00","id":1322149,"title":"","content":"remember simhatas? anyone else think of them as mysonichids?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-03T23:44:50-07:00","id":1322165,"title":"","content":"I prefer to think of them as kirin.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/612vZoTRnkL._SX425_.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/612vZoTRnkL._SX425_.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/612vZoTRnkL._SX425_.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"> https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/612vZoTRnkL._SX425_.jpg </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-04T00:57:02-07:00","id":1322179,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1320575-dinosaurs-in-exalted-3rd-edition?p=1322149#post1322149\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">remember simhatas? anyone else think of them as mysonichids?</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mesonychid\" target=\"_blank\">Mesonychids</a><br /> <br /> Somewhat. They are carnivorous ungulates, but not precisely the imagery &quot;lion horse&quot; suggests. Still, with some selective breeding...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":487,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","user":"Greyman","date":". 07-04-2019, 04:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-04T00:59:49-07:00","id":1322180,"title":"","content":"There is just one problem in your document:<br /> <br /> The claw strider isn\u00b4t feathered, and as a lover of feathered dinosaurs, and of the aesthethics of Velociraptors and Utahraptors and dinosaurs with a similar body plan, that is literally a personal insult. Choose a weapon :P<br /> <br /> <br /> Nah, seriously, it\u00b4s an amazing job.I just love the bullockornis image <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: I stand corrected. Your claw strider seems to have feathers on its arms. I\u00b4m a happy girl now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13031,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13031-clophiroth","user":"Clophiroth","date":". 07-04-2019, 04:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13031-clophiroth","name":"Clophiroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13031_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-04T09:18:30-07:00","id":1322230,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Clophiroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1320575-dinosaurs-in-exalted-3rd-edition?p=1322180#post1322180\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is just one problem in your document:<br /> <br /> The claw strider isn\u00b4t feathered, and as a lover of feathered dinosaurs, and of the aesthethics of Velociraptors and Utahraptors and dinosaurs with a similar body plan, that is literally a personal insult. Choose a weapon :P<br /> <br /> <br /> Nah, seriously, it\u00b4s an amazing job.I just love the bullockornis image <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: I stand corrected. Your claw strider seems to have feathers on its arms. I\u00b4m a happy girl now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I thought about grabbing a picture from Jurassic Park or something but decided fuck it, feathered Raptors or bust. Technically the Yeddim is hairy, but there wasn't any art of the right megafauna where people added hair. Glad you liked it! Just googled the right name, picked the coolest picture, and made it fit. I'll be keeping it updated as best I can with new releases. If you think of anything I missed, let me know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-04T10:41:53-07:00","id":1322247,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SamuraiMujuru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1320575-dinosaurs-in-exalted-3rd-edition?p=1322230#post1322230\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, I thought about grabbing a picture from Jurassic Park or something but decided fuck it, feathered Raptors or bust. Technically the Yeddim is hairy, but there wasn't any art of the right megafauna where people added hair. Glad you liked it! Just googled the right name, picked the coolest picture, and made it fit. I'll be keeping it updated as best I can with new releases. If you think of anything I missed, let me know.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> [IMG]<a href=\"https://www.nhm.ac.uk/content/dam/nhmwww/discover/dinosaur-velociraptor/Fred_Wierum_Velociraptor-two-column.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.nhm.ac.uk/content/dam/nh...two-column.jpg</a>[/IMG]<br /> <br /> This is how I describe claw striders in my games, as the most magnificent and beautiful beast in Creation. Raptok Dragon Kings are similar, but with psychodelic colour schemes, Dio-Brando-as-a-raptor-style.<br /> <br /> <br /> Coincidentially, that was my wallpaper for long months :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13031-clophiroth","name":"Clophiroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13031_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-04T10:56:14-07:00","id":1322249,"title":"","content":"So many different types of chocobo.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sh