code_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stephen Lea Sheppard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1320575-dinosaurs-in-exalted-3rd-edition?p=1322249#post1322249\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So many different types of chocobo.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The reason there were tamed Moas in my Polynesian-expy game, was because I wanted to have chocobos in all but name :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13031-clophiroth","name":"Clophiroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13031_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-05T00:52:59-07:00","id":1322363,"title":"","content":"and now, Lisowiscia, the largest non-dinosaur from the mesozoic<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/aa/Lisowicia_NT.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://static01.nyt.com/images/2019/01/05/science/05TB-FOSSIL2/merlin_148744185_a6cc0847-da8b-41f5-a81c-9e2ec72e40cb-articleLarge.jpg?quality=75&amp;auto=webp&amp;disable=upscale\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-05T09:54:53-07:00","id":1322440,"title":"","content":"What's that the ancestor of? Rhinos?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-05T10:11:26-07:00","id":1322444,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1320575-dinosaurs-in-exalted-3rd-edition?p=1322440#post1322440\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's that the ancestor of? Rhinos?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It's not related directly to anything alive today. Lisowicia is a therapsid, a group that includes the ancestors of mammals, but it belonged to a different branch of them than the one that eventually gave rise to our ancestors.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-05T13:32:42-07:00","id":1322486,"title":"","content":"yeah, it was the last of the dicynodonts. That branch died out with the End-Triassic Extinction","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T10:22:31-07:00","id":1325642,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1320575-dinosaurs-in-exalted-3rd-edition?p=1322486#post1322486\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">yeah, it was the last of the dicynodonts. That branch died out with the End-Triassic Extinction</div> </div> </div> </div>As an aside, speaking of megafauna, extinct earth species that might or not have lookalikes in Creation, convergent evolution and such, i ask myself how related or not might be the fallen Alaun to Austrechs, that some have established to be <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phorusrhacos\" target=\"_blank\">Phorusrhacos</a>, if memory tricks me not....<br /> <br /> Though now that i think of it, the Alaun, possessing fingers and hands, would possibly be in a &quot;family branch&quot; far closer to the archeopteryx, so to speak.<br /> Though &quot;degrees of association&quot;, in how a creature's design might have inspired some deity, demon, primordial or what not, to riff, tweak and such in the making of something else, than &quot;family trees&quot; per se.<br /> <br /> Damn, and now i'm asking myself if the Grey-esque primordial race exterminated by Autochton might have been inspired by some furless race of lemurs, tree frogs or who knows what.<br /> <br /> Mostly extrapolating from the sleek naked flesh &amp; big eyes i'll admit, but artistic depictions of grey aliens can vary considerabbly in detail. Damn, the association of that extinct primordial race that composes Autochton's soulsteel reserves with grey visually might be fanon for all i (don't) remember...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 07-18-2019, 02:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T21:48:51-07:00","id":1325868,"title":"","content":"doing more research for fun (I have no life), and found these images of what they think the armored terror actually looked like:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://qph.fs.quoracdn.net/main-qimg-6f9b1076e0683c11c222cfc806bf8170\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/c4045bc8-87ce-4c02-96c6-0cda7e3e652d/d9l0elw-ef69d0fb-bc9c-452a-b81d-fa9aabaf32e8.png/v1/fill/w_1778,h_449,strp/dunkleosteus_terrelli_by_spinoinwonderland_d9l0elw-pre.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..ahuHJYZLBBHuaFDdblXCkE5kSkKy8nzu9C9ze60DkAw\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> yup. instead of the armor and toothplates on the outside, it had skin and lips on it like a real animal","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T23:58:49-07:00","id":1325898,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1320575-dinosaurs-in-exalted-3rd-edition?p=1325868#post1325868\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">doing more research for fun (I have no life), and found these images of what they think the armored terror actually looked like:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://qph.fs.quoracdn.net/main-qimg-6f9b1076e0683c11c222cfc806bf8170\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/c4045bc8-87ce-4c02-96c6-0cda7e3e652d/d9l0elw-ef69d0fb-bc9c-452a-b81d-fa9aabaf32e8.png/v1/fill/w_1778,h_449,strp/dunkleosteus_terrelli_by_spinoinwonderland_d9l0elw-pre.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..ahuHJYZLBBHuaFDdblXCkE5kSkKy8nzu9C9ze60DkAw\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> yup. instead of the armor and toothplates on the outside, it had skin and lips on it like a real animal</div> </div> </div> </div>Well that's significantly less armored and terror looking. Neat from a historical/scientific perspective, but think I'll keep the classic look for my megafauna guide. \ud83e\udd23","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-31T08:16:35-07:00","id":1328533,"title":"","content":"HDNP just gave us an even bigger Quetzalcoatlus! Looks like I'm updating my document when I get home.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No 