","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-12T19:27:52-08:00","id":1354709,"title":"","content":"I hope we get some that piss heroin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12360-guitar-longcat","name":"Guitar Longcat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-13T08:27:12-08:00","id":1354775,"title":"","content":"Of special note, whereas Holden and Morke gave the glyptodon/pestetail a special attack akin to Solar Heaven Thunder Hammer, Vance decided to give the larger, stronger anklyosaurus/shieldback a MUCH weaker tail strike attack.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-02T16:06:00-07:00","id":1385315,"title":"","content":"Do I necro this thread too often?<br /> <br /> New news on Spinosaurus dropped this week. I seems it had a sortof paddle like tail for swimming.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://nerdist.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/spinosaurus-body-image-1.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> not a very strong swimmer, but clearly spent a lot of time in the water.<br /> <br /> So, how would this fare in Creation? Would this make a better river dragon? Or something different somehow?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-02T17:49:59-07:00","id":1385331,"title":"","content":"Spinosaurus being aquatic is something known for a while. The neat bit is that it apparently had yeah, tha tpaddle thing. Though that said, I tend to still use a crocodyliform for river dragons since well, Spinosaurus I don't htink looks very deathrolly and we know a lot of ancient crocs were. Plus room for something else for Spinosaurus to be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-02T18:46:20-07:00","id":1385336,"title":"","content":"honestly if it weren\u2019t for Lunars, I\u2019d be inclined to remove a lot of current existent animals from Creation and play up prehistoric animals as the norm. But I wouldn\u2019t want to rob Lunars of some of the modern animal forms with powerful symbolic meaning to players.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-02T19:21:25-07:00","id":1385341,"title":"","content":"What to name it though...River Fisher? Fisher Dragon? Ridgeback?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-02T19:41:12-07:00","id":1385344,"title":"","content":"The Chinese name apparently is spine/thorn dragon. That seems like some pretty good places to start htere for me at least. (I like thorn dragon myself).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-03T18:51:47-07:00","id":1385504,"title":"","content":"since we still have this towards the top again, I need to ask: did we do Helicoprion yet?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-03T21:08:02-07:00","id":1385531,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1320575-dinosaurs-in-exalted-3rd-edition?p=1385504#post1385504\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">since we still have this towards the top again, I need to ask: did we do Helicoprion yet?</div> </div> </div> </div>We have not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T03:09:06-07:00","id":1385567,"title":"","content":"Ok, so we need whirltooths to fight Siakas, Orcas, and armoredterrors.<br /> <br /> getting a lot of stuff for aquatic lunars now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T09:36:43-07:00","id":1385612,"title":"","content":"Might have shared this earlier, but can't hurt to link it again. <br /> <br /> I've been making a little archive of the prehistoric fauna that are present in Exalted. I've mostly stuck to things that have 3E sources, though I've included one or two from prior editions that don't have write-ups but have been mentioned (Siaka being the main one)<br /> <br /> If I've left any out, let me know and I'll gladly add them!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ra0yMjGhatuuTzNo6mSnZvvicBJK4YkCprZD-aP8zFE/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ra0yMjGhatuuTzNo6mSnZvvicBJK4YkCprZD-aP8zFE/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ra0yMjGhatuuTzNo6mSnZvvicBJK4YkCprZD-aP8zFE/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Ra0yMjGhatuuTzNo6mSnZvvicBJK4YkCprZD-aP8zFE/edit?usp=drivesdk </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T15:42:05-07:00","id":1385668,"title":"","content":"didn't we have a thread for fan made fauna too (prehistori, modern, and unreal)? or some wiki source? if not we need to get one together.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-11T08:01:29-07:00","id":1417637,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1320575-dinosaurs-in-exalted-3rd-edition?p=1385668#post1385668\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">didn't we have a thread for fan made fauna too (prehistori, modern, and unreal)? or some wiki source? if not we need to get one together.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No idea. As an aside, has anyone ever toyed with some &quot;sapient megafauna&quot; stuff, like suggested by my Alaun/Austrech association in a <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1320575-dinosaurs-in-exalted-3rd-edition?p=1325642#post1325642\">previous</a> post?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 10-11-2020, 11:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T00:33:35-07:00","id":1418782,"title":"","content":"Honestly it seems to me that I can use mostly the Tyrant Lizard stat card in the core book to mostly simulate anything that a Siaka can do. For my Siaka lunar in my narrative I'm working on I pretty much will use that for some 3rd Edition mechanics for that form. Though I'm sure there are a lot of stats given for various critters that can be adapted for stuff that don't currently show up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26449-phoenix108","name":"Phoenix108","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-25T20:28:32-07:00","id":1420207,"title":"","content":"I always wanted to play a Lunar with the entelodont as their totem form. Mainly because their nickname screams some distant origin to Isidoros.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Phoenix108</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1320575-dinosaurs-in-exalted-3rd-edition?p=1418782#post1418782\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly it seems to me that I can use mostly the Tyrant Lizard stat card in the core book to mostly simulate anything that a Siaka can do. For my Siaka lunar in my narrative I'm working on I pretty much will use that for some 3rd Edition mechanics for that form. Though I'm sure there are a lot of stats given for various critters that can be adapted for stuff that don't currently show up.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm surprised even though I really shouldn't be, considering they're both large predators that primarily rely on a big mouth and powerful propulsion from the lower body.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26460-organ-boy","name":"Organ Boy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-26T16:53:58-07:00","id":1420351,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Phoenix108</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1320575-dinosaurs-in-exalted-3rd-edition?p=1418782#post1418782\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly it seems to me that I can use mostly the Tyrant Lizard stat card in the core book to mostly simulate anything that a Siaka can do. For my Siaka lunar in my narrative I'm working on I pretty much will use that for some 3rd Edition mechanics for that form. Though I'm sure there are a lot of stats given for various critters that can be adapted for stuff that don't currently show up.</div> </div> </div> </div>You'd have to get rid of the throw effect on the jaw shake (they would let it float and either press the attack or swim down, wait for blood loss and shock to weaken the unfortunate whale, and come back to finish the job), and of course, the roar, unless you want to have siaka as <i>Otodus megalodon</i> showing off signs of their relation to modern sand tigers, which have been known to gulp air and &quot;bark&quot; it out. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VLJrPxyA_Ns\" target=\"_blank\">Not that a dinosaur should be &quot;roaring&quot;, either.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T01:23:25-07:00","id":1420419,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1320575-dinosaurs-in-exalted-3rd-edition?p=1420351#post1420351\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You'd have to get rid of the throw effect on the jaw shake (they would let it float and either press the attack or swim down, wait for blood loss and shock to weaken the unfortunate whale, and come back to finish the job), and of course, the roar, unless you want to have siaka as <i>Otodus megalodon</i> showing off signs of their relation to modern sand tigers, which have been known to gulp air and &quot;bark&quot; it out. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VLJrPxyA_Ns\" target=\"_blank\">Not that a dinosaur should be &quot;roaring&quot;, either.</a></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I like the idea of the barking. Though again have to try and adapt what you can with what is published. The throw could possibly still be performed if on or near the surface with prey that can be thrown with the head. Great White sharks do that with fur seals after they breach up underneath them...then of course the bleed out afterwards. Or well so it seems to me anyway. Also I also like to tweak things thematically with types of Siaka like what the first edition exalted did, Tiger Siaka and Mako Siaka for example. The physical attribute stats likely are pretty similar too given how many of the 'Legendary' size creatures seem to be close in the numbers, str 10 etc. But maybe the stats could change some like with the Mako maybe some more dex to simulate greater speed, or Tiger with a more powerful or bite. <br /> <br /> That is one thing I did like with the build a creature system in 2nd edition, which I'd imagine you could do the same with 3rd, taking a base creature then adding appropriate mutations and abilities. Just not sure how kosher it gets to be with the general Exalted gaming community though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26449-phoenix108","name":"Phoenix108","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}